    "paragraphs": [
      "A declared composition of accepted components: 24 cases and 72 comparisons that each change one axis. These experiments do not change the active integrated run.",
      "New bounded composition of accepted projection, retirement, classification and recognition APIs; original component implementations unchanged.",
      "One shared initial observation at10, optional retirement at20, final observation at30. Classification compares exact facet/value pairs for the selected carrier. Tracking compares observer-local initial/current identity and retirement. Recognition compares asserted candidate plus ordered resolution meanings; carrier/revision addresses remain visible in originals but are excluded only from that cross-track semantic comparison. No RNG draws.",
      "Equality uses the alignment above. Full records retain carrier identities and revision addresses.",
      "24 declared component cases and72 single-axis comparisons, not a native scheduler/Save132 run. Glen/Darius are explicitly seeded observer catalog candidates, never copied from truth. Correctness is researcher fixture context only. Reacquired-track correction is a new assertion, not a rewrite or cross-track revision. No general independence law, full CV016 or Campaign4 entry acceptance claim."
    ],
